# Contact sheets and the segmentation cache are rebuilt from the PDFs by
# `trace_from_sheet.py cards`. Only the numbers read off them are worth keeping
# -- and only once they have actually been read, one card at a time, which is
# what .unverified means when it is still on the end of a name.
*.png
*_seg.json
*.unverified

# What the OCR saw on each label, kept so a bad reading can be traced back to
# the glyphs that caused it. Rebuilt by `read_sheet_auto.py`.
*_ocr.json
